# N3: the staggered trigger under the exactness policy on the combined best: the S2 G4 staggered plan on c2-packed-tp4-best-gate.
# Users arrive 30 s apart at S3a's lengths 4096 / 16384 / 32768 / 60000 (4096 out, EOS on), so user 2's and user 3's prefills run
# AFTER padded two- and three-live packed rounds (the prefill-after-replay trigger), and every user's text is compared with its solo
# arm under the strict policy (one re-run on a first divergence), plus the padded-probe arm. Confirms the prefill warm before every
# capture still holds with the fused commit, the live banks and the levers merged into the hang-fix stack.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/next-2 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/next-2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The window's jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed
# from this branch.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image N0 builds from this same commit; a later commit needs a new tag.
# C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-2 is a PLACEHOLDER: the driver of the window may substitute it (in every template) once the image is built
# from the pushed branch; the driver's IMAGE_TAG env overrides it.
# Duration (estimate): 35-60 min, the gate's worst case (a re-run of both judged arms) about 6 h.
# STOP on the gate exit (strict): the levers are exactness claims, and a text that diverges after a padded round is a lever (or the
# warm) that is not exact; the timing jobs after it would time something that must not ship. Read each problem line before calling it:
# the plan's other S2 checks (the four-live rate net of the audits, idle commits, the probe) can fail for reasons that are not the
# trigger.
# Read (c2-gate-summary.json, staggered-concurrent/server.log): the users whose 'Prefilling 1 user(s)' line FOLLOWS a padded packed round
# ('[PINDIAG] packed padded round live=2' or 'live=3'); each IDENTICAL to solo = the trigger is exact; the '[PINDIAG] four-card prefill
# programs=' lines (a B-A-W above zero names an unwarmed shape).
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-3a
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-best-gate
C2_GATE_PLAN=staggered
C2_GATE_LENGTHS=4096,16384,32768,60000
C2_GATE_MAX_TOKENS=4096
C2_GATE_JIT=record
